WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
You sat down to pay attention. Then your mind wandered. That isn't the end of the story.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
In a small 2012 brain-imaging study, meditators pressed a button when they noticed that drift.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Researchers separated wandering, noticing, shifting back, and focusing again.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The scan did not prove that a meditation app or commercial audio can change your brain.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Try four quiet minutes. Notice when attention leaves, and gently return. No purchase needed.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ask what the evidence establishes, not what a sales promise suggests. Final Vestige Studios.
